{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18319","headline":"望禁门松雪 · 王涯","name":"望禁门松雪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宿云开霁景，佳气此时浓。\n瑞雪凝清禁，祥烟幂小松。\n依稀鸳瓦出，隐映凤楼重。\n金阙晴光照，琼枝瑞色封。\n叶铺全类玉，柯偃乍疑龙。\n讵比寒山上，风霜老昔容。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王涯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18319.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18319","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}